      "content": "idk i feel like i'm overreacting. it's getting better slightly now so maybe it was just a fluke. if i just take a high dose of sumatriptan, like double my usual dose, shouldn't that help knock out the headache and the weirdness? i'd rather just sleep it off and see how i feel in the morning than sit in an ER for 8 hours for nothing. isn't it better to just treat it as a migraine unless it gets way worse?",
